+3. **Point Evaluation**:
+   - To find the 3D position $\mathbf{p}$ at parameter $t$:
+     $$ \mathbf{p}(t) = \mathbf{o} + t \cdot \mathbf{v} $$
+   - This operation is performed component-wise:
