+### Formulas
+- **Ray Point**: $\mathbf{p}(t) = \mathbf{o} + t\mathbf{v}$
+- **Direction Normalization**: $\mathbf{v}_{norm} = \frac{\mathbf{v}}{\|\mathbf{v}\|}$
